# ASN specification v2 (supplier EDI), DESADV message. Change list against v1. Effective for shipments from the first week of next quarter.
# requirement: mandatory = shipment is rejected without it; optional = accepted if absent.
segment,field,change,requirement,format,max_length,notes
PAC,pallet_count,new,mandatory,n..4,4,number of pallets in the consignment
PAC,pallet_sscc,new,mandatory,n18,18,serial shipping container code of each pallet
PAC,pallet_type,new,mandatory,an..3,3,EUR or CHEP or one-way
PAC,cartons_per_pallet,new,mandatory,n..5,5,
PAC,units_per_carton,new,mandatory,n..5,5,
PAC,pallet_gross_weight_kg,new,mandatory,n..6.1,7,
PAC,pallet_height_cm,new,optional,n..3,3,
PAC,pallet_length_cm,new,optional,n..3,3,
PAC,pallet_width_cm,new,optional,n..3,3,
GIN,serial_number,new,optional,an..35,35,serial numbers for tracked items only
GIN,serial_number_type,new,optional,an..3,3,
DTM,ship_date,unchanged,mandatory,date,8,
RFF,po_number,unchanged,mandatory,an..35,35,
